#: model:expense.scan.policy,name:expense_scan.demo_policy
msgid "Example: a customer's requirements"
msgstr "Exemple : exigences d'un client"

#. module: expense_scan
#: model:expense.scan.policy,note:expense_scan.demo_policy
msgid "Made-up rules, set by contract with the customer: they apply to the projects of its sites, on top of the company's good practice."
msgstr "Règles fictives, fixées par contrat avec le client : elles s'appliquent aux missions de ses sites, en plus des bonnes pratiques de l'entreprise."

#. module: expense_scan
#: model:expense.scan.policy.rule,name:expense_scan.demo_policy_travel_class
